    <string name="about">
Welcome to the Redbubble Merchandise Branding App — your all-in-one platform for creating, customizing,
        and ordering branded merchandise with ease. Our goal is to simplify how individuals, groups, and
        organizations bring their ideas to life through quality, eco-friendly products. Whether you’re
        planning a wedding, organizing a community event, or representing an NGO, we empower you to design
        unique items like t-shirts, hoodies, and caps directly from your mobile device. We partner with
        verified suppliers who use sustainable materials and localized fulfillment to reduce carbon
        emissions and ensure fast delivery. With our app, you can manage bulk or on-demand orders, track
        your deliveries, and collaborate with your team — all in one intuitive space. We’re here to make
        branding smarter, greener, and accessible to everyone.


    </string>


